  "notes": "## 0.6.0-alpha.4 - 2026-05-02\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prevent clearing cache on Windows from removing saved setup, settings, and history data\n- Keep file and image clipboard history more stable when cached files are deleted or expire\n- Resume clipboard sync automatically after the background service restarts\n- Show paired devices with their real online state and update offline status sooner while the Devices page is open\n- Fix the quick panel opening to a blank window\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.6.0-alpha.4 - 2026-05-02\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复 Windows 上清理缓存可能删除已保存的设置、初始化状态和历史记录的问题\n- 提高文件和图片剪贴板历史的稳定性，避免缓存文件被删除或过期后引发异常\n- 修复后台服务重启后剪贴板同步不会自动恢复的问题\n- 修复已配对设备在线状态显示不准确的问题，并在打开设备页面时更快更新离线状态\n- 修复快捷面板打开后显示空白窗口的问题",
